# 基本文章編集 (design 11.2.6): 実身複製 puts the copy's link right after the link it was made
# from, and the caret and the other end of the selection, when they stood after that link in its
# paragraph, move on by the one place put in. The first paragraph holds 4 letters, a link and 4
# letters, with the caret at its end (End 4d): a letter is 3 places (its
# bytes) and a link one, 25. The menu is opened on the link (閉じる under the pointer at 230,135
# the first time, 実身操作 220 below, 実身複製 20 below that, to the
# right), and the console says where the caret and the other end are after it: 26, 26.
# Keys: Enter 28, Esc 29, Ctrl+E 08 01.
waitwin 原紙箱
click 1000 48
wait 300
mkbig doc 1
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document>
xml <p>仮身の前<link id="019a6c9b-e67e-7a35-a461-0d199550e4cf_0.xtad" vobjid="01a10000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001" width="160" heightpx="19" chsz="14"/>仮身の後</p>
xml <p>後の段落</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlbig
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 2
wait 800
click 125 141
wait 200
key 4d
wait 200
logmark
click 230 135 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 1000
move 240 355
wait 150
move 300 355
wait 800
shot dc_menu
move 370 375
wait 300
click 370 375
expectsince document: chosen real.duplicate
wait 1500
key 28
expectsince document: linked a copy after the link (0), 2 links
expectsince document: caret 0,26 other 0,26
wait 500
shot dc_after
key 08 01
expect document: closed
absent !OACV!
